OTE: This demo font is for PERSONAL USE ONLY! But any donation are very appreciated.<br /> Paypal account for donation : <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.paypal.me/muksalcreative" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.paypal.me/muksalcreative</a><br /> Link to purchase full version and commercial license:<br /> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://muksalcreative.com/product/wemberly-bold-friendly-memorable/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://muksalcreative.com/product/wemberly-bold-friendly-memorable/</a><br /> If you need an extended license or corporate license, please contact us at <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f8958d938b999495919699c8c0c9b89f95999194d69b9795">[email&#160;protected]</a><br /> Please visit our store for more great fonts :<a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://muksalcreative.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://muksalcreative.com/</a><br /> And follow my instagram for update : @muksalcreative</p><div class="font-preview font-preview-phrase-md font-item__preview"><div class="font-preview-text"
 data-script-name="Wemberly-Regular"
 data-font="Font Wemberly Regular. Examples of this font can be found on the font site exFont, include the number of glyphs 68 characters. You can find other similar fonts, or fonts in the same family as this font right below."
